{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL1N0YXklMjAlMjgyMDA1JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Stay","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/nrLZVP8jG0KBcabahRPp6UP7Oy2.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eUNQJ0XKHoGDDQzj1Y4WhE5zAFJ.jpg","description":"Psychiatrist Sam Foster has a new patient, Henry Letham, who claims to be suicidal. In trying to diagnose him, Sam visits Henry's prior therapist and also finds Henry's mother -- even though Henry has said that he murdered both of his parents. As reality starts to contradict fact, Sam spirals into an unstable mental state. Then he finds a clue as to how and when Henry may try to kill himself, and races to try to stop him.","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["Mystery","Thriller","Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.6","runtime":"99 min","cast":["Ewan McGregor","Naomi Watts","Ryan Gosling","Kate Burton","Elizabeth Reaser","Bob Hoskins","BD Wong","Janeane Garofalo"],"director":["Marc Forster"],"released":"2005-09-24T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Between the worlds of the living and the dead there is a place you're not supposed to stay.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Ewan McGregor","character":"Sam Foster","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/q2UDxfwWnmXTB7khOUF3J9puBVP.jpg"},{"name":"Naomi Watts","character":"Lila Culpepper","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7ysvff7ZhW388SIh2YjQ0XIryOn.jpg"},{"name":"Ryan Gosling","character":"Henry Letham","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/lyUyVARQKhGxaxy0FbPJCQRpiaW.jpg"},{"name":"Kate Burton","character":"Mrs. Letham","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/rHnt0gTvarr492I1ZIYg8VNBdPn.jpg"},{"name":"Elizabeth Reaser","character":"Athena","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gYzfVDwWI6A955MEtX1ZqfZIuN2.jpg"},{"name":"Bob Hoskins","character":"Dr. Leon Patterson","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/qOeE7bVHAsNTbP77Qk6TwrrWHZc.jpg"},{"name":"BD Wong","character":"Dr. Bradley Ren","photo":"https://image